	(text "Input: the pin through 100k to the ADC; with the 20k leg grounded (default) 15 V reads 2.5 V, with DIRECT high the range is 0-2.5 V. BURDEN adds 120 R for 4-20 mA loops; PULLUP (range switch sheet) adds 10k to +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "145dcb2e-53ae-5737-bf00-1bd1ab7db391")
	)
	(text "Universal I/O channel 4: connector pin 1 = switched sensor supply, 2 = signal, 3 = GND. Output: DAC level x 4.83 from a TSB582 section through a switch (IO Output Drivers sheet), up to 100 mA, open while OUT_EN is low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3484422c-748c-57b7-a04e-b3078691a4cd")
	)
	(text "Every control line is pulled to its off level, so the channel is high impedance with the sensor supply off until firmware sets the expander."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ebfef98-5c76-5027-9c2c-0613e2dfc228")
	)
